<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Hong Leong Bank year net up 37 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hong Leong Bank year net up 37 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 192.67   vs	 140.29</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 39.0    vs	  30.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,477.28   vs	 995.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   316.34   vs	 223.82</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 7.5    vs	   6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Hong Leong Bank Bhd is engaged in all aspects of commercial banking, and it is also in property investment and development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
